  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "THE END\n(Of everything)\n\nVERDGE\n\nMade by: Please, Let Me Cook! studios\nPublisher:
    June Folks\n\nMain Idea - basic_eagles\nGame & Level Design - Arkasha\nCode -
    sSakuray\n3D Models - HANDLER\n2D Art & Visual - basic_eagles\nMusic - Amireal,
    kitear\nSound Design - Freesound.org\n\nSpecial thanks to:\nNeonoire, Partiza\n\nTracks
    used:\nAmireal - Place Deep Inside\n\nFreesound credits:\n\nBrick-Drop-Concrete-06.wav
    by DWOBoyle -- https://freesound.org/s/145695/ -- License: Attribution 4.0\n\nwind
    draft loop 3 by nsstudios -- https://freesound.org/s/651545/ -- License: Attribution
    4.0\n\nmetalbarrelkick_02.wav by sarana -- https://freesound.org/s/83180/ --
    License: Attribution 4.0\n\nClick by complex_waveform -- https://freesound.org/s/213148/
    -- License: Attribution 4.0\n\n-----------------------------\n\nAnd special thanks
    you for playing VERDGE!\n\nOriginally, the game idea was created for a game jam,
    but over time it turned into a full game. We all hope you enjoyed this short
    story, told in a very uneven and strange way.\n\nI will use these credits to
    tell you a bit of a story, and I wouldn\u2019t be surprised if it breaks the
    fourth wall in some ways. We are not a greedy AAA studio that just wants you
    to buy a game. We\u2019re just regular humans- like you - who are playing this
    game.\n\nThe game was stuck between producing chaos and was remade two or three
    times. The graphic style was changed about three times. The lore was rewritten
    twice, and the entire game idea had to be completely rebuilt.\n\nI think the
    main moral is simple: keep moving forward and never give up. Only because of
    this mindset was this game created and finished.\n\nPLMC was ahead! O7"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0737cb738bd5109469ba59b4cb74e351, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 281967962810816550, guid: 0737cb738bd5109469ba59b4cb74e351, type: 2}
